The stockholders elected Mary Fisher and Andrew Sandler M.D. as Class I directors to hold office for a term of three years, until their
successor is duly elected and qualified or they are otherwise unable to complete their term. The votes were cast for this matter as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

